    "系统墙纸资源已更新，需要修复自定义分类名称。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "System wallpaper resources changed. Repair the Custom category name."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统墙纸资源已更新，需要修复自定义分类名称。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "旧版自定义壁纸（%lld）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Legacy custom wallpapers (%lld)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "旧版自定义壁纸（%lld）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "迁移会保留原 UUID 和视频主副本，改用当前自定义分类。旧 MP4 素材只搬迁文件，播放兼容性仍需实机确认。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Migration preserves the UUID and original video while moving to the current Custom category. Legacy MP4 playback still needs device validation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "迁移会保留原 UUID 和视频主副本，改用当前自定义分类。旧 MP4 素材只搬迁文件，播放兼容性仍需实机确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "迁移旧版自定义壁纸": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
